@startuml propfirm-c4-containers
!theme plain
title PropFirm — Container diagram (UML deployment / C4-style)

actor Trader
actor Admin

node "Browser" {
  component "Next.js UI :3100" as UI
}

node "App host" {
  component "NestJS API :6080\n(DDD modules + bus)" as API
}

database "Postgres :15433\n(schemas per BC)\nTypeORM" as PG
component "Mailpit\nSMTP :2525 / UI :8026" as Mail
component "Redis :6380\n(reserved)" as Redis
cloud "ip-api.com\n(IP intel)" as IP

Trader --> UI : HTTPS
Admin --> UI
UI --> API : REST + JWT
API --> PG : TypeORM
API --> Mail : SMTP
API --> IP : lookup on login
API ..> Redis : optional cache

note right of UI
  **No frontend ORM**
  Data via REST only
end note

note right of API
  ORM lives here only
  (TypeORM entities)
end note
@enduml
